<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men' singles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Sunday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding)</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Arnaud Clement (France) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>14-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 6-7</p>
<p>(7-9) 6-3 6-2 4-6 14-12</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Andrew Richardson (Britain) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden) 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-2 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat 15-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) beat Sandon Stolle (Australia) 6-3 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-2 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p> Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Guillaume Raoux (France)   7-5 6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 7-6 (9-7) 6-3</p>
<p>4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat David Rikl (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-4 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>12-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Jens Knippschild (Germany)</p>
<p>6-3 4-6 6-3 6-0</p>
<p>John Van Lottum (Netherlands) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Marcos Ondruska (South</p>
<p>Africa) 7-5 6-1 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Mark Petchey (Britain) beat Tommy Haas (Germany) 7-6  (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>9-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Dennis Van Scheppingen</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-2 6-3 6-7 (1-7) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 6-2</p>
<p>3-6 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Neville Godwin (South Africa) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>6-7 (6-8) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-2</p>
<p>4-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) beat Patrick Baur (Germany) 7-5 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-1</p>
<p>(ends men's singles Sunday results)</p>
</text>
